<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Welcome to Arizona Lionhearts</title>
</head>

<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f4f6f9;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;">
<table bgcolor="#f4f6f9" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
	<tbody>
		<tr>
			<td align="center" style="padding:20px;">
			<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;" width="600"><!-- HEADER -->
				<tbody>
					<tr>
						<td align="center" style="background-color:#21194f;padding:20px;" class=""><img alt="Arizona Lionhearts Logo" src="https://storage.pardot.com/1126833/1781259488F0jGv9HY/Arizona_logo.png" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:480px;height:auto;border:0;" width="480"></td>
					</tr>
					<!-- BODY -->
					<tr>
						<td style="padding:25px;color:#333333;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;" class="">
						<h2 style="margin-top:0;">Hi {{Recipient.FirstName}}</h2>

						<p>Welcome to <strong>Arizona Lionhearts</strong> — we're excited to have you as part of our community!</p>

						<p>Our mission is to empower individuals and families through impactful programs, health support, and meaningful community engagement.</p>

						<table border="0" cellpadding="15" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f9fafc;" width="100%">
							<tbody>
								<tr>
									<td class=""><strong>What you can do with us:</strong>

									<ul style="padding-left:20px;margin:10px 0;">
										<li>Join impactful community programs</li>
										<li>Access health and support services</li>
										<li>Participate in volunteer initiatives</li>
									</ul>
									</td>
								</tr>
							</tbody>
						</table>

						<p style="font-weight:bold;color:#222;">Your journey with us starts today — and we're here every step of the way.</p>

						<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
							<tbody>
								<tr>
									<td bgcolor="#ff6b00" style="padding:12px 24px;border-radius:5px;" class=""><a href="https://azlionhearts.com/" style="color:#ffffff;
                                  text-decoration:none;
                                  font-weight:bold;">Visit Our Website </a></td>
								</tr>
							</tbody>
						</table>

						<p>If you have any questions, feel free to reach out — we're always happy to help!</p>

						<p>Warm regards,<br>
						<strong>Arizona Lionhearts Team</strong></p>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<!-- BANNER IMAGE -->
					<tr>
						<td align="center" style="padding:0 20px 20px 20px;" class=""><img alt="Arizona Lionhearts" src="http://go.pardot.com/l/1126833/2026-06-12/kqk1g6/1126833/17812598421kNacc7m/Arizona_image__2" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:560px;height:auto;border:0;" width="560"></td>
					</tr>
					<!-- FOOTER -->
					<tr>
						<td align="center" style="background:#f1f1f1;padding:15px;font-size:12px;color:#555;" class="">
						<p style="margin:5px 0;">Contact Us - Call at <strong>480-253-9360</strong> or Text at <strong>480-253-9377</strong></p>

						<p style="margin:5px 0;"><a href="{{EmailPreferenceCenter}}" style="color:#555;text-decoration:none;">Manage Preferences </a> | <a href="{{Unsubscribe}}" style="color:#555;text-decoration:none;"> Unsubscribe </a></p>

						<p style="margin:5px 0;color:#888;">© 2025 Arizona Lionhearts. All rights reserved.</p>

						<p style="margin:5px 0;color:#888;">This is an automated message. Please do not reply.</p>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>
			</td>
		</tr>
	</tbody>
</table>
</body>
</html>